| Severity | Count | Description |
|----------|-------|-------------|
| 🔴 **CRITICAL BUG** | 3 | Will cause runtime errors or silent failures |
| 🟠 **MISMATCH** | 3 | Wrong HTTP method, endpoint path, or param format |
